---
title: Chinese Hash
author: Mary Arntson
category: Casseroles
cook time: 1 hour
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@hamburger{1%lb}
@chopped celery
@small chopped onion{1}
@pepper{1%dash}
@rice{0.5%cup}
@cream of chicken soup{1%can}
@warm water{1.5%cups}
@cream of mushroom soup{1%can}
@soy sauce{0.25%cup}
@Chinese noodles{1%can}

Brown hamburger, chopped celery, and chopped onion. DON'T add salt. Add pepper, rice, cream of chicken soup, warm water, cream of mushroom soup, and soy sauce. Bake cover for 1/2 hour at 375 degrees. Uncover and bake 15 minutes more. Add a can of Chinese noodles on top and bake 15 minutes more.
